  "description": "Object storage for .NET over MinIO and any S3-compatible server. Inject IObjectStorage and upload, download, stream, list, copy and share objects, and let a bucket expire what it holds: failures come back as data instead of exceptions, reads stream instead of buffering, ranged reads work, and retries, a circuit breaker, tracing and logging are built in. Several servers side by side through keyed registration, settings validated at startup.",
